"`bandwidth_limit_mbps` como float em Mbps e objetos `PostProcessAction`."

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/data-access/download.md:197
msgid ""
"The returned list always has the same length and order as the input, "
"including items rejected by optical validation, which come back as failed "
"results. See [`DownloadResult`](../reference/python-api.md#downloadresult) "
"for every field."
msgstr ""
